  "solution": "Given : 54 * 36 * 12 * 18 * 24 * 24\n\nSo according to BODMAS rule :\n\n__\n \n• **Option - (1): ** +, ×, -, ÷, =\n\n​⇒ 54 + 36 × 12 - **18 ÷ 24**__ = 24\n\n⇒ 54 + __**36**____** × 12**__ - 0.75 = 24\n\n⇒ __**54 + 432**__ - 0.75 = 24\n\n⇒ __**486 - 0.75**__ = 24\n\n⇒ 485.25 ≠ 24 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2): ÷, +, ×, -, =\n\n⇒ 54 ÷ 36__ + 12 × 18 - 24 = 24\n\n⇒ 1.5 + **__12 × 18__** - 24 = 24\n\n⇒ __**1.5 + 216**__ - 24 = 24\n\n⇒ __**217.5 - 24**__ = 24\n\n⇒ 193.5 ≠ 24 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3): ÷, ×, +, -, =​\n\n⇒ 54 ÷ 36__ × 12 + 18 - 24 = 24\n\n⇒ __**1.5 **____**×**____** 12**__ + 18 - 24 = 24\n\n⇒ __**18 +18**__ - 24 =24\n\n⇒ __**36 - 24**__ = 24\n\n⇒ 12 ≠ 24 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4): **÷, ×, -, +, =**\n\n⇒ 54 ÷ 36__ × 12 - 18 + 24 = 24\n\n⇒ __1.5 ____×____ 12__ - 18 + 24 = 24\n\n⇒ 18 - __**18 +24**__ = 24\n\n⇒ **24 = 24 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, **\"****÷, ×, -, +, =\"** is the correct answer.\n\n50",
